            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Becky, thank you for your feedback! We understand your concerns regarding the kitchen supplies and hygiene items, and we’ll take your comments into account to enhance our guest experience. We appreciate your loyalty and hope to welcome you back for a third stay!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This is the second time we stayed at the property. This was a new management company. Their communication was great! The home was clean especially the kitchen appliances. The kitchen drawers and some of the dishes needed cleaning, but I’m thinking previous guests were part of the problem. I was a little surprised with a home that size, only one kitchen towel was provided and one roll of toilet paper per bathroom. The communication informed us that there wouldn’t be enough supplies for the stay, but for the price of the home that seemed a little cheap not to furnish another roll of toilet paper.",
